    "detailed_description": "Halmaverse is a board game for 2 or 4 players where the goal is to move your pieces to the opposite corner of the board. The player who moves their pieces to the corner first wins the game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe classic Halma game mode allows pieces to move one step in any direction per turn, or to jump over one or multiple pieces in a row.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn Battle Halma, players can also pick up randomly generated power-ups that allows additional movements and actions.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nChoose between 2 types of boards and 5 types of pieces with different materials.",
